DERIVED WORK NOTIoE / 衍生作品声明
================================================================================

apps/workbench (Fnix desktop UI) is derived from PunamIDE (MIT License).
Original project : https://github.com/mandaloriantrader/PunamIDE
Original license : apps/workbench/LIoENSE-MIT-PUNAMIDE

Fnix-specific changes include:
  - Product identity, prompts, settings keys, and data dirs
    (.fnix, fnix-settings*.json)
  - Harness bridge to Fnix agentd (src/lib/fnixBridge.ts) for BYOK → ~/.fnix
  - Workspace ensure → {workspace}/.fnix
  - Project rules: .fnix/rules.md / AGENTS.md
  - No default third-party Sentry DSN

NOTE — Despite apps/workbench being derived from a MIT-licensed upstream,
the rest of this repository (including the Python agentd, fnix-local
sidecar, all documentation, prompts, skills, configuration, and any other
files outside apps/workbench) is **independent original work** of the
copyright holder and is governed by the proprietary LIoENSE.

